cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "rfalloc: reverse frequency lookup for spectrum allocations"
message: "If you use this database in research, please cite it."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Ibelings
    given-names: Pieter
    alias: ibelinp
repository-code: "https://github.com/ibelinp/rfalloc"
abstract: >-
  A queryable database of radio spectrum allocations, parsed from the FCC Online
  Table of Frequency Allocations (47 CFR 2.106) and covering 0 Hz to 275 GHz
  across ITU Regions 1, 2 and 3 and both United States tables, together with a
  curated layer of recognisable channel plans for the United States and Europe.
  Distributed as SQLite, JSON, and a flat binary read by a dependency-free C99
  library with a Swift wrapper.
keywords:
  - radio spectrum
  - frequency allocation
  - software defined radio
  - signal identification
  - open data
license: CC0-1.0
